  "description": "Statically analyzes JavaScript (JScript) web resources and their form/event usage for performance and deprecation risks — deprecated Xrm.Page, synchronous XMLHttpRequest, blocking alert(), excessive console logging, repeated retrieve/Xrm.WebApi calls, hardcoded GUIDs/URLs, unsupported DOM manipulation, and oversized scripts. Maps scripts to the forms and events that call them, flags forms with too many OnLoad handlers, produces a per-script heuristic risk score with code line context and confidence labels, and Excel/PDF/JSON/HTML/Markdown/CSV exports. Fully offline (no runtime), read-only.",
